  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:300px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkorange pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Nuclear Energizing</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c5/Godzilla_Earth_infobox.png/revision/latest?cb=20230327200229\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Godzilla Earth infobox\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c5/Godzilla_Earth_infobox.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20230327200229\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c5/Godzilla_Earth_infobox.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20230327200229 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c5/Godzilla_Earth_infobox.png/revision/latest?cb=20230327200229 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Godzilla Earth infobox\" width=\"270\" height=\"381\" data-image-key=\"Godzilla_Earth_infobox.png\" data-image-name=\"Godzilla Earth infobox.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Godzilla (Godzilla) is a living biological furnace, strengthening himself with atomic energy.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Be enhanced by nuclear energy/connected forces.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>absorb nuclear energy/connected forces to improve the bodily functions</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Absorption\" title=\"Nuclear Absorption\">Nuclear Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energized_Body\" title=\"Energized Body\">Energized Body</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear_Energizing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can enhance themselves through absorbing nuclear energy/connected forces and converting it into bodily energy to perform superhuman feats.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear_Energizing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Energy Manipulation\">Bio-Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Manipulation\">Bio-Nuclear Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Dynamo\">Bio-Nuclear Dynamo</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bodily_Attribute_Augmentation\" title=\"Bodily Attribute Augmentation\">Bodily Attribute Augmentation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Body/Supernatural\" title=\"Peak Human Body/Supernatural\">Supernatural Body</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Absorption\" title=\"Nuclear Absorption\">Nuclear Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Conversion\" title=\"Nuclear Conversion\">Nuclear Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Empowerment\" title=\"Nuclear Empowerment\">Nuclear Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetism_Empowerment\" title=\"Electromagnetism Empowerment\">Electromagnetism Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Empowerment\" title=\"Heat Empowerment\">Heat Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ion_Empowerment\" title=\"Ion Empowerment\">Ion Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Sustenance\" title=\"Self-Sustenance\">Self-Sustenance</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear_Energizing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Manipulation\" title=\"Nuclear Manipulation\">Nuclear Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Semi-Immortality\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Semi-Immortality\">Semi-Immortality</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear_Energizing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May need to keep absorbing energy over periods of time to maintain biological stability.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FNuclear_Energizing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Bombshell (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Captain Atom (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Firestorm (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Major Force (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Wendall Vaughn/Quasar (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Doctor Solar (<i>Valiant Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Wall Eehto (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li>\n<li>Godzilla (<i>Godzilla</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260804105837\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 105/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 133/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000